if?t=1781618208\" width=402 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113640/extras/0655178ee772a21d5523a5620e9469b3.webm?t=1781618208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113640/extras/0655178ee772a21d5523a5620e9469b3.mp4?t=1781618208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEDOM OF MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget rigid animations and simplistic hitboxes. In Clairvoyance, you're in control:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight hitboxes on every limb</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully independent head movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-attack micro-positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined, you can bob and weave around attacks like never before while simultaneously preparing your counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113640/extras/ccc05af62804daddd6464106dc64024c.poster.avif?t=1781618208\" width=546 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113640/extras/ccc05af62804daddd6464106dc64024c.webm?t=1781618208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113640/extras/ccc05af62804daddd6464106dc64024c.mp4?t=1781618208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NATURALLY FLOWING ATTACKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move has a starting and an ending stance. With this physical logic for combo creation and execution, make use of the natural levels of &quot;friction&quot; in using one move after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play